# Build context for apps/api/Dockerfile (used by the api/migrate compose services).
# The Dockerfile copies packages/contracts and apps/api wholesale; without this file
# the host's node_modules would be COPY'd over the image's fresh pnpm install, and
# Windows junction symlinks would dangle inside the Linux image (MODULE_NOT_FOUND in
# the contracts build). Secrets and local state never belong in the image either.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
.git
.env
.env.*
*.log
coverage
